{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42805","headline":"酬勾评事 · 刘兼","name":"酬勾评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲庭欹枕正悲秋，忽觉新编浣远愁。\n才薄只愁安雁户，年高空忆复渔舟。\n鹭翘皓雪临汀岸，莲嫋红香匝郡楼。\n对景却慙无藻思，南金荆玉卒难酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}